deded;\"><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h6><a href=\"#top\">back to top<\/a><\/h6>\n<h3 id=\"postersA\">Posters<\/h3>\n<p>Note: Poster boards will be 2m high x 1m wide. Velcro will provided for fixing.<\/p>\n<h4>Accepted Posters &#8211; Session A<\/h4>\n<ol>\n<li><em>Towards Enabling the Semantic Access of Phenotypic Information in Clinical Letters &#8211;\u00a0<\/em>Shahad Kudama, Rafael Berlanga, Henry Houlden, Ernesto Jimenez-Ruiz, Hallgeir Jonvik, Adam Milward, Huw Morris, Mina Ryten, Jake Saklatvala, Michael Simpson and Nicholas Wood.<\/li>\n<li><em>OncoCL-KB, a knowledgebase for integration of clinical and molecular cancer data<\/em> &#8211;\u00a0Mary E Dolan.<\/li>\n<li><em>COPO &#8211; Linked Open Infrastructure for Plant Data<\/em> &#8211; Felix Shaw, Anthony Etuk, Alejandra Gonzalez-Beltran, Phillip Rocca-Serra, Paul Kersey, Ruth Bastow, Susanna-Assunta Sansone, Vicky Schneider and Robert Davey.<\/li>\n<li><em>Visualising ontologies with AberOWL<\/em> &#8211; Miguel \u00c1ngel Rodr\u00edguez-Garc\u00eda, Luke Slater, Keiron O&#8217;Shea, Paul Schofield, Georgios Gkoutos and<a href=\"http:\/\/leechuck.de\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Robert Hoehndorf<\/a>.<\/li>\n<li><em>Towards an Imaging Biomarker Ontology based on the Open Biological and Biomedical Ontologies Foundry<\/em> &#8211; Emna Amdouni, Yannick Morvan and Bernard Gibaud<\/li>\n<li><em>RDF-Based Integration with SPARQL Building System for Life Science Database Archive<\/em>\u00a0&#8211; Atsuko Yamaguchi, Katsuhiko Okubo, Norio Kobayashi, Kouji Kozaki, Sadahiro Kumagai, Kai Lenz, Tomoe Nobusada, Hongyan Wu, Yasunori Yamamoto and Hideki Hatanaka<\/li>\n<li><em>From letters to pixels &#8211;<\/em>\u00a0Kenneth McLeod, Albert Burger, Christopher Armit, Bill Hill and Richard Baldock.<\/li>\n<li><em>Performance evaluation of human resources in a hospital<\/em> &#8211; Angel Esteban-Gil, Jesualdo Tom\u00e1s Fernandez-Breis and Clara Miranda-Lopez.<\/li>\n<li><em style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">\u201cWhere do you go from here?\u201d Semantics of directions in biological pathways &#8211;\u00a0<\/em>Ryan Miller, Martina Kutmon, Egon Willighagen, Andra Waagmeester, Jonathan Melius, Anwesha Bohler, Nuno Nunes, Peter Woollard and Chris Evelo.<\/li>\n<li><em>Digital Dr. House: A semantic alerting platform for the ICU<\/em> &#8211; Femke Ongenae, Bram Gadeyne, Femke De Backere, Liesbet De Bus, Pieter Depuydt, Johan Decruyenaere and Filip De Turck.<\/li>\n<li><em>Automated Generation of SADI Web Services for Clinical Intelligence using Ruled-Based Semantic Mappings<\/em> &#8211; Mohammad Sadnan Al Manir, Alexandre Riazanov, Harold Boley, Artjom Klein and Christopher J.O. Baker.<\/li>\n<li><em>GraphScope &#8211; the smart data access engine for RDF &#8211;\u00a0<\/em>Daniel M. Herzig and G\u00fcnter Ladwig.<\/li>\n<li><em>Exposing French agronomic resources as Linked Open Data<\/em> &#8211; Aravind Venkatesan, Nordine El Hassouni, Florian Philippe, Cyril Pommier, Hadi Quesneville, Manuel Ruiz and Pierre Larmande.<\/li>\n<li><em>Feasibility of Modeling HL7 FHIR Profiles Using RDF Shape Expressions Language<\/em> &#8211; Harold Solbrig, Eric Prud\u2019hommeaux, Deepak Sharma, Christopher Chute and Guoqian Jiang.<\/li>\n<li><em>Semantically indexed resources to facilitate data integration in the Agronomic domain &#8211; International Data Discovery System<\/em> &#8211; Florian Philippe, Aravind Venkatesan, Nordine El Hassouni, Cyril Pommier, Manuel Ruiz, Pierre Larmande and Hadi Quesneville.<\/li>\n<li><em>RDF-based data sharing of bio-resource related information<\/em>\u00a0&#8211; Hiroshi Masuya, Terue Takatsuki, Mikako Saito, Eiki Takayama, Kazuya Ohshima, Nozomu Ohshiro, Kai Lenz, Nobuhiko Tanaka, Hiroshi Mori, Shuichi Kawashima and Norio Kobayashi.<\/li>\n<li><em>RDF2Graph a tool to recover, understand and validate the ontology of an RDF resource<\/em> &#8211;\u00a0Jesse CJ van Dam, Jasper J Koehorst, Peter J Schaap, Vitor AP Martins dos Santos and Maria Suare