dverse Drug Reaction Signals<\/em> &#8211; Vasileios Koutkias, Pantelis Natsiavas and Nicos Maglaveras.<\/li>\n<li><em>UniProt-GOA: A central resource for data integration and GO annotation<\/em> \u00a0&#8211; Melanie Courtot, Aleksandra Shypitsyna, Elena Speretta, Alexander Holmes, Tony Sawford, Tony Wardell, Maria J. Martin and Claire O&#8217;Donovan.<\/li>\n<li><em>Dem@Care: Ambient Sensing and Intelligent Decision Support for the Care of Dementia<\/em> &#8211; Thanos Stavropoulos, Georgios Meditskos and Ioannis Kompatsiaris.<\/li>\n<li><em>SPARQL Playground<\/em>\u00a0&#8211; Daniel Teixeira, Alain Gateau, Olivier Evalet, Frederic Nikitin, Jerven Bolleman, Monique Zahn, Pascale Gaudet, Lydie Lane, Amos Bairoch and Pierre-Andre Michel.<\/li>\n<li><em>Information from Semantic Integration of Texts and Databases<\/em> &#8211;\u00a0Erik van Mulligen, Wytze Vlietstra, Rein Vos and Jan Kors.<\/li>\n<li><em>Measuring the Usability of Triple Stores for Knowledge Management on Trauma Care Organizations<\/em> &#8211;\u00a0Joseph Utecht and Mathias Brochhausen.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h6><a href=\"#top\">back to top<\/a><\/h6>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Main Conference Programme Location:\u00a0Riley Auditorium, Gillespie Center, Clare College Jump to: Conference day one Conference day two Accepted posters\u00a0&#8211; Session A Accepted posters &#8211; Session B &nbsp; Conference Day One &#8211; Tuesday 8th December Time Title Type Chair 08:30 Registration &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/cambridge2015\/programme\/main-conference\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1853,"parent":1214,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1530","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1